  "briefing": {
    "title": "THE TURN",
    "story": [
      "DIRECTOR HALEX (cold, unhurried): \"Warden. Vane is ash; you performed",
      "adequately. Final directive from the Reach: Aether Prime is reclassified a",
      "Category-One biohazard. Operation Cauterize begins at dawn. Your last task",
      "before extraction — the Emberhand wounded in the eastern camps. No survivors.",
      "No witnesses. Confirm and comply.\"",
      "",
      "MARSHAL CORR (private channel, low): \"...Warden. That is not a war order.",
      "That is a massacre, and the man giving it is already burning the planet under",
      "you. I can't send it and I won't. Whatever you're going to do — do it now.",
      "Their loyalists are already turning their guns around.\""
    ],
    "objectives": [
      "Refuse the purge — survive the Directorate until the cordon breaks (5:00)",
      "Link up with Vane's raiders at the eastern ravine"
    ]
  },
  "debrief": {
    "win": [
      "The Directorate cordon cracks and pulls back to the ridge. Out of the ash-haze,",
      "Emberhand raiders fold your survivors into their line without a word of welcome.",
      "SERA VANE, at last: \"So. The Concord's favourite dog slipped its leash. Good.",
      "You run with the wolves now, Warden — or you don't run at all.\""
    ],
    "lose": [
      "The purge is thorough. The Warden's column burns with the rest of the evidence,",
      "and Cauterize proceeds on schedule. No survivors. No witnesses. As ordered."
    ]
  },
